# =============================================================================
#  BATMAN - MAIN MENU IDLE LOOP  ("Presence")               Roblox R15 / MrXen0 rig
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  HOW TO USE
#    1. Open your MrXen0_R15RIG .blend in Blender (5.0+ recommended).
#    2. Scripting workspace -> Text Editor -> New -> paste this whole file.
#    3. Press  Run Script  (Alt+P).  Done - the armature now has the action
#       "Batman_Idle" assigned and the timeline set to 60 fps, frames 0-360.
#
#  WHAT IT DOES
#    * deletes any old "Batman_Idle" action first (no lingering keyframes)
#    * sets the rig to FK mode (ARM_IK_FK / LEG_IK_FK = 0)
#    * keys ONLY the animated FK controls (full-body loop, so legs/pelvis are keyed)
#    * all curves BEZIER + AUTO_CLAMPED, with a Cycles modifier so the loop seam
#      is smooth (frame 360 == frame 0)
#
#  TIMING (60 fps):   360 frames = 6.0 s - heavy, grounded, economical
#    stance  : wide planted feet, toes slightly out, knees soft, chest broad and lifted, lats flared,
#              chin down with eyes up. Slow deep breath every 90 f keeps him alive in the holds.
#    44-196  : hands rise and clasp in front of the chest; two slow knuckle presses (100, 128);
#              slow neck roll with a crack (head tilts, snaps, rolls to the other side)
#    150-260 : arms release and drop with weight, hands trailing; one heavy exhale
#    200-352 : cold scan - head turns slowly right, holds, then sweeps left and back to centre
#
#  This is a FULL-BODY loop (idle display) - export it as a Looped animation and do
#  NOT apply the upper-body-only bone filter.
# =============================================================================
